-- הסכם אופק חדש (25.12.2008), §52 מבנה שבוע העבודה של מורים שאינם
-- אקדמאים: a non-academic under the reform works the academic teacher's
-- week.

IMPORT prelude
IMPORT `base-agreement-15`
IMPORT `base-agreement-17`

-- not weighed against `the Hours of Work and Rest Law`: the section gives
-- these teachers the week another section of the agreement sets (§§15, 17 or
-- 18) and changes none of its hours; it adds no hour the law counts, and the
-- week is weighed, where it is on the law's subject, in that section's file.

§ `52 מבנה שבוע העבודה של מורים שאינם אקדמאים`

@ref akn:art_52
GIVEN stage IS A `school stage`
GIVETH A `work week`
DECIDE `a non-academic teacher's full week` stage IS
    IF stage EQUALS `a primary school` THEN `a primary teacher's full week` ELSE `a junior-high teacher's full week`

#ASSERT `hours of the week` (`a non-academic teacher's full week` `a junior high school`) EQUALS 36
